{ "name": "Test", "slug": "test" }
### Expected: 403 Forbidden


### 2. Without token must be 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "slug": "test" }
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized


